But you also don't want to go full crook.

2202
02:03:30,750 --> 02:03:35,810
Maybe that's, you know, a bit of a problem, those two sentences.

2203
02:03:36,110 --> 02:03:37,710
They don't really vibe together, do they?

2204
02:03:38,990 --> 02:03:39,850
That's the point.

2205
02:03:40,030 --> 02:03:40,990
You've now learned a lesson.

2206
02:03:43,250 --> 02:03:44,410
What am I doing?

2207
02:03:44,670 --> 02:03:46,490
Stop doing whatever I'm doing.

2208
02:03:48,110 --> 02:03:48,650
Hey.

2209
02:03:49,090 --> 02:03:50,110
Oh, torches, torches.

2210
02:03:50,410 --> 02:03:51,010
There we go.

2211
02:03:51,510 --> 02:03:53,050
Now, are you ready?

2212
02:03:53,430 --> 02:03:57,010
We're about to explore this goddamn place.

2213
02:04:02,760 --> 02:04:03,320
Nothing.

2214
02:04:03,320 --> 02:04:04,880
This is a very small one.

2215
02:04:06,220 --> 02:04:08,160
I bet there's no loot in there.

2216
02:04:09,080 --> 02:04:11,220
Oh, in this room, there's loot.

2217
02:04:11,380 --> 02:04:13,480
In that room, no loot.

2218
02:04:14,820 --> 02:04:15,380
Watch.

2219
02:04:25,700 --> 02:04:28,540
I wonder how they made those sounds for the Enderman.

2220
02:04:35,700 --> 02:04:38,580
I thought maybe I could speedrun over there using the fruit.

2221
02:04:45,300 --> 02:04:46,180
Ultimate tactics.

2222
02:04:46,780 --> 02:04:48,920
What if I eat and jump while I eat?

2223
02:04:53,500 --> 02:04:53,980
Really?

2224
02:04:54,220 --> 02:04:54,480
Wait.

2225
02:04:58,690 --> 02:05:02,950
Oh, maybe it doesn't... Not bad!

2226
02:05:03,230 --> 02:05:03,550
Hey!

2227
02:05:03,950 --> 02:05:04,550
Pretty sick.

2228
02:05:07,580 --> 02:05:09,540
That comes back, and I grab it again.

2229
02:05:10,440 --> 02:05:12,560
Yeah, it's actually... oh, okay.

2230
02:05:15,120 --> 02:05:15,640
Yeah!

2231
02:05:16,020 --> 02:05:17,800
I don't know why it sometimes hits.

2232
02:05:18,180 --> 02:05:19,060
Other times it doesn't.

2233
02:05:20,340 --> 02:05:21,440
It's just orangey.

2234
02:05:22,160 --> 02:05:23,080
That one's bad.

2235
02:05:25,620 --> 02:05:26,600
That one's good.

2236
02:05:26,920 --> 02:05:27,600
There we go.

2237
02:05:27,940 --> 02:05:28,900
Penetrated his shell.

2238
02:05:30,600 --> 02:05:32,900
Now we're gonna do the staircase.

2239
02:05:34,120 --> 02:05:35,000
Not like that.

2240
02:05:36,340 --> 02:05:37,200
Like this.

2241
02:05:38,500 --> 02:05:39,860
Like that, and like that.

2242
02:05:40,260 --> 02:05:40,820
Beautiful.

2243
02:05:42,880 --> 02:05:46,460
It's like there was a staircase here, but then half of it went missing.

2244
02:05:48,240 --> 02:05:50,940
Why did... this is so... elegant.

2245
02:05:51,600 --> 02:05:53,100
What an elegant solution.

2246
02:05:53,900 --> 02:05:55,600
To a problem I once had.

2247
02:05:56,060 --> 02:05:56,900
But no more.

2248
02:06:02,680 --> 02:06:03,280
Got him.

2249
02:06:03,620 --> 02:06:05,360
I wonder if my axe is better for this.

2250
02:06:06,160 --> 02:06:10,640
One hit, two hit, three... Nah, it's way too strong.

2251
02:06:11,680 --> 02:06:12,420
It sucks.

2252
02:06:12,960 --> 02:06:13,100
Yep.

2253
02:06:14,120 --> 02:06:16,580
And look, as I predicted, no loot in here.

2254
02:06:17,600 --> 02:06:18,940
This is a no loot.

2255
02:06:20,840 --> 02:06:22,200
But where did I predict loot?

2256
02:06:23,340 --> 02:06:25,020
Ooh, down here, didn't I?

2257
02:06:25,120 --> 02:06:25,680
But there was nothing.

2258
02:06:28,160 --> 02:06:29,340
My prediction was wrong.

2259
02:06:31,970 --> 02:06:32,730
Damn.

2260
02:06:33,130 --> 02:06:34,690
There's nothing at all here.

2261
02:06:35,730 --> 02:06:36,750
That's sad.

2262
02:06:47,200 --> 02:06:48,420
Man, these guys are nothing.

2263
02:06:48,640 --> 02:06:50,840
How did I ever have so much trouble with this?

2264
02:06:51,280 --> 02:06:52,880
It's like the easiest thing in the world.

2265
02:06:55,380 --> 02:06:56,160
Where's my torch?

2266
02:06:59,720 --> 02:07:02,940
I guess it's where the other... Oh, there it is.

2267
02:07:10,060 --> 02:07:10,480
Right?

2268
02:07:10,680 --> 02:07:11,380
That's gotta be.

2269
02:07:14,040 --> 02:07:14,460
Yeah.

2270
02:07:15,160 --> 02:07:20,060
Okay, so now I actually want to go back to this place and we're gonna keep going in this direction.

2271
02:07:20,440 --> 02:07:22,320
We are being so systematic right now.

2272
02:07:22,440 --> 02:07:22,960
I love it.

2273
02:07:24,660 --> 02:07:25,900
Really proud of myself here.

2274
02:07:26,680 --> 02:07:27,380
Great moves.

2275
02:07:31,760 --> 02:07:33,580
And everyone else needs to get out of my way!

2276
02:07:39,090 --> 02:07:41,230
I wonder what caused these guys to disappear last time.

2277
02:07:41,810 --> 02:07:44,310
I thought maybe it was because I conquered it, you know?

2278
02:07:49,910 --> 02:07:51,010
And I became the king.

2279
02:07:51,930 --> 02:07:55,850
Oh, see, this torch right here is not visible from over there, so I'm gonna put an extra one here.

2280
02:07:57,750 --> 02:07:58,110
There.

2281
02:08:00,010 --> 02:08:03,990
That way, when I'm over there, I can see it easily.

2282
02:08:05,130 --> 02:08:05,650
Come on.

2283
02:08:21,090 --> 02:08:23,570
I kind of want to put another torch, just because it looks nice.

2284
02:08:25,390 --> 02:08:29,850
It gives a little bit of a homey feeling to an otherwise very not-homey place.

2285
02:08:30,810 --> 02:08:31,870
You know what I'm saying, homie?

2286
02:08:35,610 --> 02:08:41,870
I don't think I've ever used that word, like, in a sincere manner, in a sentence.

2287
02:08:43,290 --> 02:08:44,250
Like, what's up, homie?

2288
02:08:46,590 --> 02:08:46,990
Ever.

2289
02:08:47,470 --> 02:08:48,750
Maybe once in a video game.

2290
02:08:53,150 --> 02:08:56,370
Okay, so we are gonna keep heading west.

2291
02:08:56,530 --> 02:08:58,170
And yes, I call this direction west.

2292
02:08:59,910 --> 02:09:01,410
We're gonna go west.

2293
02:09:06,320 --> 02:09:07,400
And be on the lookout.

2294
02:09:08,880 --> 02:09:10,920
By the way, any more achievements in here?

2295
02:09:13,400 --> 02:09:14,760
Only these, I guess.

2296
02:09:15,080 --> 02:09:17,220
Or there could be also hidden ones, remember that.

2297
02:09:20,140 --> 02:09:26,600
The city at the end of the game should be cities, not one city.

2298
02:09:27,720 --> 02:09:31,600
Unless there is a... No, wait, I was about to say.

2299
02:09:32,020 --> 02:09:34,100
Maybe there's a major city and minor cities.

2300
02:09:35,100 --> 02:09:39,880
But the fact that I already got this achievement just means I got to a city.

2301
02:09:41,920 --> 02:09:42,940
Find Elytra.

2302
02:09:44,380 --> 02:09:45,360
I've done this one.

2303
02:09:45,440 --> 02:09:46,860
I've done everything except these.

2304
02:09:49,260 --> 02:09:52,040
And potentially hidden ones that I don't know about.

2305
02:09:52,500 --> 02:09:53,680
Because they're hidden nature.

2306
02:10:01,510 --> 02:10:03,330
You know what the background reminds me of now?

2307
02:10:03,430 --> 02:10:04,330
It's like tapestry.

2308
02:10:07,410 --> 02:10:08,650
It's like Truman Show.

2309
02:10:09,230 --> 02:10:09,830
You know?

2310
02:10:10,090 --> 02:10:13,210
Like, I'm living in this globe that is not real.

2311
02:10:13,590 --> 02:10:15,170
It's being televised, actually.

2312
02:10:15,450 --> 02:10:16,630
It's kind of true.

2313
02:10:17,590 --> 02:10:19,170
You know, it's... yeah.

2314
02:10:21,510 --> 02:10:22,590
I have no more blocks.

2315
02:10:23,210 --> 02:10:25,110
I have to get some.

2316
02:10:37,640 --> 02:10:39,200
Also, what was the plan here?

2317
02:10:39,600 --> 02:10:42,120
So, I'm gonna get the elytra.

2318
02:10:43,260 --> 02:10:47,880
When I have that, I'm gonna... Oh, you know what I could do, actually?

2319
02:10:48,420 --> 02:10:56,400
Oh, dude, when I find elytra, I'm gonna ascend with blocks really high, and I'm gonna fly.

2320
02:10:57,720 --> 02:11:00,460
I just need a little bit of height, right, to get going.

2321
02:11:01,640 --> 02:11:03,120
That is actually genius.

2322
02:11:04,510 --> 02:11:05,950
We don't need fireworks.

2323
02:11:11,830 --> 02:11:12,670
Oh my god.

2324
02:11:13,470 --> 02:11:14,590
Hopefully I muted in time.

2325
02:11:15,070 --> 02:11:15,870
Had a bit of a sneeze there.

2326
02:11:18,250 --> 02:11:20,010
I almost took off with that sneeze.

2327
02:11:20,150 --> 02:11:21,730
Similar to how you take off with fireworks.

2328
02:11:22,470 --> 02:11:23,430
When you have elytra.

2329
02:11:32,440 --> 02:11:32,880
Okay.

2330
02:11:33,660 --> 02:11:34,300
You know what's funny?

2331
02:11:34,460 --> 02:11:39,380
If you're in space, you would actually take off in a direction if you sneezed.

2332
02:11:40,760 --> 02:11:43,520
Assuming some of your snot came out of your nose in the process.

2333
02:11:44,960 --> 02:11:46,080
It would propel you.

2334
02:11:46,420 --> 02:11:47,200
Isn't that funny?

2335
02:11:47,320 --> 02:11:48,000
Similar to farting.

2336
02:11:52,750 --> 02:11:53,990
Okay.

2337
02:11:55,330 --> 02:11:57,650
Uh... Right, this way.

2338
02:11:58,130 --> 02:11:59,270
Put down torches.

2339
02:12:00,750 --> 02:12:01,990
Boop!

2340
02:12:06,870 --> 02:12:07,370
Hey, dude!

2341
02:12:08,070 --> 02:12:09,190
Do you mind if I look at your legs?

2342
02:12:09,350 --> 02:12:09,410
Huh?

2343
02:12:09,530 --> 02:12:09,770
Look at them.

2344
02:12:09,810 --> 02:12:10,530
Mmm, nice legs.

2345
02:12:10,650 --> 02:12:11,030
Nice legs.

2346
02:12:11,250 --> 02:12:11,450
Mmm.

2347
02:12:12,810 --> 02:12:13,930
I'm looking at your chest now.

2348
02:12:14,850 --> 02:12:15,470
They don't care.

2349
02:12:15,590 --> 02:12:16,390
It's only their eyes.

2350
02:12:18,430 --> 02:12:19,550
I shouldn't play with fire, though.

2351
02:12:20,830 --> 02:12:22,810
But I really needed to do that just now.

2352
02:12:29,790 --> 02:12:30,730
We eat a lot of this.

2353
02:12:39,850 --> 02:12:40,470
Awesome.

2354
02:12:40,930 --> 02:12:41,370
Ooh!

2355
02:12:41,650 --> 02:12:42,830
You heard that sound?

2356
02:12:43,090 --> 02:12:47,190
That was the exact sound the Endermen make when they teleport.

2357
02:12:48,250 --> 02:12:49,770
Wait, I just got disoriented.

2358
02:12:50,910 --> 02:12:52,050
Where did I come from?

2359
02:12:55,170 --> 02:12:55,970
That way.

2360
02:12:57,870 --> 02:12:59,110
And then put a torch.

2361
02:13:00,830 --> 02:13:04,850
What am I seeing?

2362
02:13:11,470 --> 02:13:12,490
Nothing that way.

2363
02:13:14,970 --> 02:13:16,730
And I was gonna go in one direction anyway.

2364
02:13:18,490 --> 02:13:20,250
Stick to the script.

2365
02:13:22,350 --> 02:13:23,270
Don't veer off.

2366
02:13:23,890 --> 02:13:29,170
A lot of producers spend a lot of time together with the writers to make this happen right here.

2367
02:13:29,610 --> 02:13:32,330
I can't just, you know, go off script like that.

2368
02:13:34,190 --> 02:13:35,630
It don't work like that, bruh.

2369
02:13:42,120 --> 02:13:43,700
Come on, show me the goodies.

2370
02:13:44,900 --> 02:13:50,860
So it seems to me the elytra is only ever present in the floating ship.

2371
02:13:52,260 --> 02:13:55,580
At least that's, so far, the only places I've found them.

2372
02:14:00,680 --> 02:14:01,280
What's that?

2373
02:14:02,000 --> 02:14:02,440
Oh.

2374
02:14:02,680 --> 02:14:03,260
Oh, whoa!

2375
02:14:05,400 --> 02:14:05,840
No.

2376
02:14:06,060 --> 02:14:06,320
Okay.

2377
02:14:07,020 --> 02:14:07,360
We're good.

2378
02:14:07,660 --> 02:14:08,080
We're good.

2379
02:14:09,360 --> 02:14:11,040
So I'm almost walking a straight line here.

2380
02:14:11,100 --> 02:14:11,360
This is good.

2381
02:14:13,880 --> 02:14:14,980
Let's go across here.

2382
02:14:33,950 --> 02:14:34,470
Nice!

2383
02:14:35,430 --> 02:14:35,950
Torch!

2384
02:14:39,430 --> 02:14:41,570
I think I used half of my torches at this point.

2385
02:14:42,290 --> 02:14:43,690
I better find something soon.

2386
02:14:52,850 --> 02:14:53,990
Okay, straighten out.

2387
02:14:54,090 --> 02:14:54,710
Oh, this is nice.

2388
02:14:55,730 --> 02:14:58,230
No islands, just the plains.

2389
02:15:07,800 --> 02:15:10,080
Reveal to me a city.

2390
02:15:12,280 --> 02:15:15,080
Grant me access to the city.

2391
02:15:16,580 --> 02:15:19,360
Let me pillage your city.

2392
02:15:22,060 --> 02:15:25,100
Actually kind of fucked up that I just go in here and steal all this shit, right?

2393
02:15:25,280 --> 02:15:25,980
Similar to villages.

2394
02:15:29,120 --> 02:15:30,480
I guess these guys mined.

2395
02:15:30,600 --> 02:15:31,820
They attack me on sight.

2396
02:15:33,560 --> 02:15:35,660
Whereas villagers... I don't know, man.

2397
02:15:35,740 --> 02:15:36,420
They just don't care.

2398
02:15:37,080 --> 02:15:38,420
I take all their stuff.

2399
02:15:39,260 --> 02:15:40,240
Doesn't even face them.

2400
02:15:42,800 --> 02:15:45,040
Okay, I see a potential place for a bridge.

2401
02:15:45,860 --> 02:15:46,880
I'm gonna take it.

2402
02:15:50,300 --> 02:15:50,920
Right here.

2403
02:15:54,000 --> 02:15:55,600
I should get more of this before I start.

2404
02:15:56,040 --> 02:15:57,840
I already have almost two blocks.

2405
02:15:58,200 --> 02:15:59,000
Two stacks.

2406
02:16:10,970 --> 02:16:14,070
I was thinking, I should maybe try to play Minecraft with a controller.

2407
02:16:14,290 --> 02:16:14,850
How would that feel?

2408
02:16:15,350 --> 02:16:18,490
I think it would feel terrible, given the inventory management.

2409
02:16:20,270 --> 02:16:21,910
Yeah, I would probably hate it.

2410
02:16:24,150 --> 02:16:25,430
How would you even do that?

2411
02:16:26,890 --> 02:16:27,770
And you know what?

2412
02:16:27,810 --> 02:16:30,470
You have to be precise with the mouse placement sometimes.

2413
02:16:32,290 --> 02:16:35,590
I think that would be really bad on a controller.

2414
02:16:36,670 --> 02:16:38,490
In tense situations, there's no way.

2415
02:16:38,760 --> 02:16:40,500
You would instantly have to switch back.

2416
02:16:44,640 --> 02:16:45,280
Switchback.

2417
02:16:45,480 --> 02:16:46,400
Isn't that a song?

2418
02:16:46,780 --> 02:16:47,640
Where they go switchback.

2419
02:16:49,320 --> 02:16:51,120
And then some electronic shit happens.

2420
02:16:52,580 --> 02:16:55,360
Keycards, ATMs, that sort of thing.

2421
02:16:55,800 --> 02:16:57,340
But in a rhythmic manner.

2422
02:16:58,000 --> 02:17:00,100
Similar to how I had rhythmic visions earlier.

2423
02:17:01,200 --> 02:17:04,220
Of deserts and people leaving.

2424
02:17:04,660 --> 02:17:05,560
Other people.

2425
02:17:06,980 --> 02:17:07,880
Remember that?

2426
02:17:08,260 --> 02:17:08,760
Whoops.

2427
02:17:08,980 --> 02:17:09,320
Oh no!

2428
02:17:09,680 --> 02:17:10,420
Oh, we're having enough.

2429
02:17:10,520 --> 02:17:11,720
Why did I panic just now?

2430
02:17:12,570 --> 02:17:13,350
I didn't panic.

2431
02:17:13,490 --> 02:17:18,550
It was just a little bit of, you know, indecisiveness is not the right word.

2432
02:17:19,210 --> 02:17:19,690
Torch it!

2433
02:17:20,250 --> 02:17:20,770
No, don't.

2434
02:17:20,830 --> 02:17:22,070
That's the wrong word of that.

2435
02:17:22,250 --> 02:17:23,650
Usage of that word, for sure.

2436
02:17:24,650 --> 02:17:25,530
Don't want to do that.

2437
02:17:26,610 --> 02:17:27,550
I'm going to keep going.

2438
02:17:27,710 --> 02:17:29,370
Look at all this openness here.

2439
02:17:30,050 --> 02:17:31,390
Absolutely nothing in sight.

2440
02:17:32,870 --> 02:17:33,710
Here's another thing.

2441
02:17:34,410 --> 02:17:37,970
I haven't found anything else in here except those cities.

2442
02:17:39,270 --> 02:17:43,430
I wonder if I'm unlucky or if there's just nothing else, you know?

2443
02:17:44,730 --> 02:17:46,290
Would love to find something new.

2444
02:17:48,730 --> 02:17:50,110
Or an elytra.

2445
02:17:50,290 --> 02:17:50,770
I would take it.

2446
02:17:51,050 --> 02:17:51,970
I would take an elytra.

2447
02:17:52,350 --> 02:17:52,870
And you know what?

2448
02:17:53,270 --> 02:17:55,690
Dude, the next elytra I'm going to be so careful with.

2449
02:17:55,690 --> 02:17:56,630
It's going to be my little baby.

2450
02:17:57,170 --> 02:17:58,890
I will not let it out of my sight.

2451
02:17:59,710 --> 02:18:01,470
I will caress it.

2452
02:18:01,630 --> 02:18:03,210
I will, you know, feed it.

2453
02:18:03,610 --> 02:18:06,090
Do everything I can to take care of that elytra.

2454
02:18:08,930 --> 02:18:09,870
We gotta heal up here.

2455
02:18:17,830 --> 02:18:18,310
Okay.

2456
02:18:18,310 --> 02:18:19,130
Keep going.

2457
02:18:20,050 --> 02:18:20,370
Wait.

2458
02:18:21,190 --> 02:18:22,430
I don't know which way is west.

2459
02:18:23,590 --> 02:18:24,410
This way, right?

2460
02:18:24,750 --> 02:18:25,490
Oh, shit.

2461
02:18:25,490 --> 02:18:26,070
I think it is.

2462
02:18:26,790 --> 02:18:28,390
I may have gone off path here.

2463
02:18:31,030 --> 02:18:31,950
And look around.

2464
02:18:32,130 --> 02:18:32,850
Don't be blind now.

2465
02:18:35,590 --> 02:18:36,970
Okay, this... Oh, nice.

2466
02:18:37,070 --> 02:18:38,530
I see an easy bridge over there.

2467
02:18:39,910 --> 02:18:41,050
