I could put a bundle in here, actually.

3129
02:52:54,860 --> 02:52:56,280
That is not the worst idea.

3130
02:52:58,200 --> 02:52:59,200
Yeah, let's do it.

3131
02:53:00,020 --> 02:53:00,860
