But you know what?

3172
02:54:53,830 --> 02:54:57,810
I did put a lot of important stuff in the box before I did this.

3173
02:54:58,450 --> 02:54:59,270
It's okay.

3174
02:54:59,950 --> 02:55:02,710
It sucks, but it's okay.

3175
02:55:03,990 --> 02:55:05,370
God damn, dude.

3176
02:55:05,910 --> 02:55:07,390
What a way to go, huh?

3177
02:55:08,350 --> 02:55:08,850
I...

3178
02:55:09,870 --> 02:55:14,630
I had it in my mind, you know, I'm going up high, I'm gonna fly to the ship, like I planned all along.

3179
02:55:16,370 --> 02:55:18,690
How wrong I... You know, at least we're home.

3180
02:55:19,470 --> 02:55:20,590
Thank God I didn't put a bet.

3181
