I'm gonna be honest, I actually really like that I didn't put a bet.

3182
02:55:26,510 --> 02:55:27,430
We're dying here.

3183
02:55:29,690 --> 02:55:30,390
Don't kill me.

3184
02:55:32,250 --> 02:55:32,990
Don't kill me.

3185
02:55:37,960 --> 02:55:38,480
Okay.

3186
02:55:38,480 --> 02:55:39,820
That wasn't that bad, actually.

3187
02:55:39,940 --> 02:55:41,820
Yeah, it felt way worse in the moment.

3188
02:55:42,700 --> 02:55:45,400
But now that I think about it, it's fine.

3189
02:55:46,720 --> 02:55:48,460
