3202
02:56:22,930 --> 02:56:23,310
How about that?

3203
02:56:24,430 --> 02:56:26,050
Actually, the sun will rise very soon.

3204
02:56:27,230 --> 02:56:28,270
He's about to come over here.

3205
02:56:28,370 --> 02:56:29,330
I don't like that at all.

3206
