What's that sound?

3208
02:56:40,960 --> 02:56:43,500
Oh, I thought someone was knocking at the door.

3209
02:56:43,820 --> 02:56:45,080
It was something in the game.

3210
02:56:47,440 --> 02:56:48,200
That's weird.

3211
02:56:53,000 --> 02:56:53,520
Okay.

3212
02:56:54,260 --> 02:56:56,860
Oh, it just rendered.

3213
02:57:00,980 --> 02:57:04,540
That just... I feel like I'm on edge right now when I shouldn't be.

3214
02:57:05,480 --> 02:57:08,200
Well, I guess I am close to dying and, you know, all that.

3215
02:57:09,300 --> 02:57:13,920
But other than that... We got an archer.

3216
