So the beacon is rendering in first, look.

3254
02:59:33,520 --> 02:59:35,000
And the mountain later.

3255
02:59:36,580 --> 02:59:37,620
That's weird.

3256
02:59:39,580 --> 02:59:40,300
Huh.

3257
02:59:42,080 --> 02:59:42,800
Okay.

3258
