But I have done everything I said I would today, and I've been the way I said I would be.

3268
03:00:22,960 --> 03:00:23,340
Yep.

3269
03:00:25,580 --> 03:00:27,520
This was all according to plan, in fact.

3270
03:00:32,860 --> 03:00:33,280
Okay.

3271
