4878
04:20:01,710 --> 04:20:05,010
Redeemed... on-screen celebration.

4879
04:20:05,270 --> 04:20:08,290
What the... Man, Twitch is something else.

4880
04:20:10,590 --> 04:20:11,030
Okay.

